\section{Conclusions}

We have determined the character sum $\mathcal S(L)$ for the quadratic form $\mathrm{Tr}(xL(x))$ with some $q$-linear polynomial $L$ over $\mathbb F_{q^n}$, and characterized associated permutation polynomials using Theorem \ref{permutation}. This raises new challenges in discovering more permutation polynomials, and motivates a systematic study towards the classification of quadratic forms defined by polynomials. Apart from constructions of permutation polynomials of specific forms, properties of permutation polynomials within this framework also deserve a further investigation.

\bibliographystyle{abbrv}
\bibliography{references}

